      'Opening deal: 2-4 player(s), 4 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in deal_batch; dealer may use deal, reveal_market before play_loop.',
      'Scoring check: At round end score captured cards and sur markers: 7 points for clubs majority (Haft Khaj), 1 each Ace, 1 each Jack, 2 for 2 of Clubs, 3 for 10 of Diamonds, and 5 per sur. Expected outcome: 62.',
